SkyPos←{
   ⍝ Converts geocentric equatorial ⍵ to altitude/azimuth
   ⍝ ⍺ is the observer: LAT,DATE,TIME
    lat date time←⍺
    sun←(24÷Data.YRLENGTH)×Data.YRLENGTH|date-Data.EQUINOX
    rot←PI×(sun+time-12)÷12
    colat←Radian 90-lat
    gq←CarTriplet ⍵
    gq←gq÷⍉(⌽⍴gq)⍴Norm gq
    gq←gq+.×(LongRotate rot)+.×LatRotate colat
    alt←Degrees ArcSin gq[;2]
    s←-×gq[;3]
    az←(360×s≤0)+s×Degrees ArcCos(-gq[;1])÷Norm gq[;1 3]
    alt,[1.5]az }
